    "justification": "Replay-backed builder canary for source-grounded research synthesis: the builder must reconcile a tiny conflicting local research packet into a cited JSON decision artifact, reject stale and scoped-conflicting sources, and expose objective citation-discipline evidence. It uses the existing replay, verifier-calibration, predicate, and objective-metric paths so `pnpm kota eval run` remains deterministic and network-free. No past KOTA failure run exists for this exact research-synthesis measurement gap, so the fixture stays smoke-classified; recording provenance is traced in recordings/provenance.md and both recordings cite the completed source workflow run used by `record-agent-step`."
